ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn the office, Wang Qiang is the project team leader, and Zhang Wei is Wang Qiang's old deputy. The project team recently brings in a new member Li Li, Wang Qiang and Zhang Wei do not know much about her technical background. Today, Wang Qiang and Zhang Wei arrange for Li Li to complete a task independently, and this task is usually Zhang Wei's responsibility. Li Li works hard in front of the computer, Zhang Wei stands behind her for a while, then walks towards Wang Qiang, the two exchange a complex look. Wang Qiang nods slightly, Zhang Wei returns to his seat, they do not have further conversation. Li Li notices all of this, but continues to focus on her screen.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Wang Qiang let Li Li complete this task that is usually Zhang Wei's responsibility independently?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Because Wang Qiang wants to give Zhang Wei some relaxation time.\nB. Wang Qiang is not satisfied with Zhang Wei's work efficiency.\nC. Wang Qiang wants to test whether Li Li can complete the task independently.\nD. Because this task is actually very simple, it does not require Zhang Wei's expertise.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003172583927163664,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58e0d9aa9dc5a833d5fb1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477581058,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:59:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"988ef0c3013d4f3697e7ad4